# Mawloc: "If that creature would die THIS TURN, exile it instead" - the replacement is made by the ability itself, and holds
# for the whole turn. Mawloc (X = 0, a 2/2) fights Bot2's Aang, Swift Savior (2/3): Mawloc dies, Aang survives with 2 damage,
# and later in the turn a Lightning Bolt that would kill Aang exiles it instead of putting it into the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Forest
Mox Ruby
Mawloc
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Aang, Swift Savior
Island x20

